# Consolidates commit authorship onto the repository owner.
#
# `git log`, `git shortlog -sne` and `git blame` honour this file, so local
# history reads as a single author without rewriting any commits.
#
# NOTE: GitHub's contributors sidebar does NOT read .mailmap — it keys off the
# raw author email on each commit. Fully removing a co-author from that view
# requires rewriting history and force-pushing; see docs/ATTRIBUTION.md.
